    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/35df8678a4829f20f0164892bbe17e25.poster.avif?t=1754178452\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/35df8678a4829f20f0164892bbe17e25.webm?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/35df8678a4829f20f0164892bbe17e25.mp4?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/90f611e7e58a83e9ec679c27ee101b12.poster.avif?t=1754178452\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/90f611e7e58a83e9ec679c27ee101b12.webm?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/90f611e7e58a83e9ec679c27ee101b12.mp4?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You will have to solve more than 20 special puzzles using a camera capable of capturing objects from reality to pocket subspace and back.<br>Not to mention the many &quot;filters&quot; that complement the functionality of the device or even replace it, as well as a large number of test elements. The gameplay together represents a unique phenomenon with the possibility of implementing creative and logical thinking.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/8e51bc55f044b0be26314799a7a955a9.poster.avif?t=1754178452\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/8e51bc55f044b0be26314799a7a955a9.webm?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/8e51bc55f044b0be26314799a7a955a9.mp4?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/4261cb415b705cc602ea5d8b9e0c330c.poster.avif?t=1754178452\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/4261cb415b705cc602ea5d8b9e0c330c.webm?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/4261cb415b705cc602ea5d8b9e0c330c.mp4?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The author's soundtrack, created specifically for the game, will support you at every step.<br>Minimalistic graphics will allow you to feel the contrast between the unexplored dark backstage and liminal tests more clearly.<br>The combination of a unique retro-futuristic style and music creates a special unforgettable atmosphere.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/00f43fb03fe1a2c152cabbd04be06483.poster.avif?t=1754178452\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/00f43fb03fe1a2c152cabbd04be06483.webm?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/00f43fb03fe1a2c152cabbd04be06483.mp4?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/9d1a25ffc812103d2be7548d685dbd61.poster.avif?t=1754178452\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/9d1a25ffc812103d2be7548d685dbd61.webm?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/9d1a25ffc812103d2be7548d685dbd61.mp4?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Plunge into the adventure of the bowels of a huge scientific and industrial complex, revealing the secrets. Why are you alone? Who is this mysterious voice? Where are all the employees? You will have to answer these questions and many others. However, be vigilant, your curiosity can lead to dangerous unforeseen consequences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/2b4e5a49b313cbbad22b2187949634f7.avif?t=1754178452\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/642fabd8a7b993be0cf5324f3999468e.poster.avif?t=1754178452\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/642fabd8a7b993be0cf5324f3999468e.webm?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846770/extras/642fabd8a7b993be0cf5324f3999468e.mp4?t=1754178452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 20 unique mechanics<br></li><li>Original soundtrack for whole game<br></li><li>More than 20 unique puzzles<br></li><li>Collectables content<br></li><li>Interesting visual solutions     <br></li><li>Narrative level desi